## Pipeline history
- G0: 2026-05-23 — drafted from Burke Playbook (FRD/FGD pattern)

## Implementation Notes for Codex (P1)
- D1 pattern at new D1 bar: `iClose(NULL,PERIOD_D1,2)`, `iHigh(NULL,PERIOD_D1,3)`, `iOpen(NULL,PERIOD_D1,1)` etc.
- Store pattern state as global bool `frd_active` / `fgd_active` at new D1 bar
- M5 EMA20: `iMA(NULL,PERIOD_M5,20,0,MODE_EMA,PRICE_CLOSE,0)` — real-time
- Session check: `TimeHour(TimeLocal()) >= 7 && TimeHour(TimeLocal()) < 12` (broker time offset needed)
- One entry per Day3: guard with `trade_placed_today` bool
- P3 sweeps: EMA period (13/20/34), session (London/NY/both), TP (30/50/75 pips), SL (15/20/25 pips)

